REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

Musculoskeletal: Reports lower back pain.
Neurological: Denies radiating pain or numbness.

PHYSICAL EXAM

Musculoskeletal
Lumbar spine: Full range of motion with pain with rotation.

RESULTS

