   - Medical Treatment: We will schedule a physical therapy session for the patient. X-ray of the right knee has been ordered. We will obtain CMP to monitor Xeljanz levels every 2 months.

Patient Agreements: The patient understands and agrees with the recommended medical treatment plan.
